                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The Return is the final part in the Reversion trilogy and it is noticable that the production quality of this title is way higher than its previous parts, with lots of locations and high-quality cutscenes. The game ties together the story pretty well, playing on fun tropes and various pop-cultural references. I also liked that the devs managed to get in a touch of their own Argentinian culture (which does makes sense, the game is set there after all).\n\nDefinitely recommending the full trilogy for point n click fans, even though the initial chapter might feel a bit off-putting as the final chapter makes it worth it.\n",
